# Chạy qua Docker: http://localhost:8080
# Chạy trực tiếp Visual Studio: http://localhost:5217
@COSGeniusSystem_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register a new user
POST {{COSGeniusSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "khoa_admin",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van Khoa",
  "email": "khoa@example.com",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "roleCode": "ADMIN"
}

### 2. Login to get token
# @name login
POST {{COSGeniusSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "khoa_admin",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### Save Token from Login response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 3. Get Current User Info (Requires Bearer Token)
GET {{COSGeniusSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Logout (Blacklists current token)
POST {{COSGeniusSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Access profile again after logout (Should be rejected with 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{COSGeniusSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
